u with a [single] call from the earth, immediately you will come forth.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"30:26","t":"And to Him belongs whoever is in the heavens and earth. All are to Him devoutly obedient.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"30:27","t":"And it is He who begins creation; then He repeats it, and that is [even] easier for Him. To Him belongs the highest description [i.e., attribute] in the heavens and earth. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"30:28","t":"He presents to you an example from yourselves. Do you have among those whom your right hands possess [i.e., slaves] any partners in what We have provided for you so that you are equal therein [and] would fear them as your fear of one another [within a partnership]? Thus do We detail the verses for a people who use reason.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"30:29","t":"But those who wrong follow their [own] desires without knowledge. Then who can guide one whom Allāh has sent astray? And for them there are no helpers.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"30:30","t":"So direct your face [i.e., self] toward the religion, inclining to truth. [Adhere to] the fiṭrah of Allāh upon which He has created [all] people. No change should there be in the creation of Allāh. That is the correct religion, but most of the people do not know.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"30:31","t":"[Adhere to it], turning in repentance to Him, and fear Him and establish prayer and do not be of those who associate others with Allāh","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"30:32","t":"[Or] of those who have divided their religion and become sects, every faction rejoicing in what it has.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":32,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[30],"sajdah":false}